# This CITATION.cff file was generated for the RMONA repository.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Riemannian-MONA: Curvature-Aware Manifold Optimization for Orthogonal Constraints"
abstract: >-
  RMONA is a PyTorch optimizer for orthogonal-constrained optimization. On the
  Stiefel manifold it combines an exact spectral-metric-problem (SMP) descent
  direction with an EMA gradient-difference curvature channel transported
  across tangent spaces via reprojection.
authors:
  - name: "RMONA contributors"
date-released: "2026-08-17"
version: "0.1.0"
license: "MIT"
keywords:
